event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":", making the rapid production of daily news a reality.\n\nIn conclusion, the history of the printing press is a journey","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" from the scarcity of information to its abundance. From the clay types of China to the metal alloys of Gutenberg and the steam","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":"-powered giants of the Victorian era, each iteration of printing technology has expanded the boundaries of human consciousness. By democratizing","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

